  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loving Pre-School Education in Java, Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCKN Foundation offers quality Montessori pre-school education for toddlers and pre-schoolers aged 1-6. Now 20% of them learn free of charge; TCKN plans to increase this number so that cost is not a barrier for any child and to expand its facilities as it has reached the capacity of its current traditional wooden village house.  It emphasises a nourishing values-based learning environment in which children feel cared for, loved, safe and can learn and grow in harmony with the natural world.</narrative>
  </description>
